e Info tab in the DWS (Diagnostic Web Server) indicating whether the DWS has been enabled or is disabled."}]},{"id":"-TrRmzw4sm6SUtdSxcRPL","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18876: Removed the size limitation for .js and .brs presentation files. While BrightAuthor:connected no longer has limits on presentation file sizes, note that BSN.Cloud limits file uploads to 5 GB."}],"listStart":2},{"id":"T58cuHu-eWwHWHtFNuYmt","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":3,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18887: Content URLs in BSN.Cloud now reside behind a redirection service so that the actual URLs are not exposed."}]},{"id":"6BFXVAZu3SsJwCo3YC-BH","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18892: Improved the Screens tab (under Presentation) so that there is a consistent UI for Series 5 and Series 6 presentations."}],"listStart":4},{"id":"NWTPLGUrxiOG-b2nlAt1U","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":5,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18906: Previously, if a 500 response (HTTP 500 - Internal Server Error) was received during a file upload, the entire upload would fail. New upload logic has been implemented where the upload will be retried several times before failing."}]},{"id":"BX1yt4Px6-cdvLZVN15p2","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"Fixes","bold":true}]},{"id":"6ogf7XSsG43D1FcscgId7","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18638: In instances where a player has more than one connected USB storage device, both USB tabs (e.g., USB and USB2) in the DWS (Diagnostic Web Server) would display the same info. This has been fixed so that each tab displays info for its respective USB storage device."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc"},{"id":"-MqTpPYCz8_JXPhJXibGA","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18687: Fixed an issue where selecting \"Latest release OS: 9.1.32\" (Admin \u003e Setup \u003e Player Settings \u003e BrightSignOS Update) for the LGUV5N player would result in a fatal error."}],"listStart":2},{"id":"B3uDBVBB0FyehUBPQaW3b","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":3,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18771: Corrected obsolete URLs on the Network Maintenance window."}]},{"id":"sCvRa4goTyqvDFB1kMegR","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18784: Fixed an issue where 4K videos could not be included in presentations for HD6 players."}],"listStart":4},{"id":"0WiIT3g1eyg0ma5cjBWcb","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":5,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18830: Removed the \"Enable Dolby Vision (single video zone only)\" option (Presentation \u003e Layout Settings) for XT5 players given that those players do not support this capability."}]},{"id":"U8HQsz3n4VGGC9dvyVD2W","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18837: Fixed an issue where a dynamic playlist consisting of a single PNG image would not display because the display duration value would be incorrectly set to null."}],"listStart":6},{"id":"_55wlXz4NfJBgL0fW9THT","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":7,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18865: Fixed an issue where a players configured for the Local Network Publishing Mode would disappear from the Schedule tab when BrightAuthor:connected is relaunched."}]},{"id":"9dld3901QhFcysI2LQtbH","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","children":[{"text":"BCN-18884: Applied a responsive layout to the download buttons on the Storage Encryption page in the DWS (Diagnostic Web Server) to accommodate varied window sizes."}],"listStart":8},{"id":"G-_prafvcrgxTVNQ8jROx","type":"paragraph","indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":9,"children":[{"text":"BCN-18885: The OS version displayed for players was often incorrect as it was based on outdated cache data. OS versions are now updated at least once daily."}]},{"id":"H0ByF7EjfLn9MbI0XQErs","type":