, and one special character."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":4},{"id":"ynFgIi2cgPunT4dNrAbJL","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18389: Previously, the Local Diagnostic Web Server (LDWS) provided the option to change the password or to remove the password entirely. The ability to remove the password has been removed. In addition, password validation will occur to ensure that they be at least 8 characters long and include at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number, and one special character."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":5},{"id":"XT0xE3f8RqmOya2Zp83xr","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18390: Removed the ability to enable the Local Diagnostic Web Server from the Remote Diagnostic Web Server."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":6},{"id":"-zkno3-9RSztqXbl5WkRI","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18398: Removed the Telnet option from the Diagnostic Web Server and added validation for the SSH password. Password must be at least 8 characters long and include at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number, and one special character."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":7},{"id":"3WoAIcpTfWOA5_k-br9yR","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18401: Added a button to the Diagnostic Web Server to enable resetting of SSH host keys."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":8},{"id":"LyAhU1uDRe89GA_KK-H__","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18435: Enabling the Local Web Server now requires a username and password. Password must be at least 8 characters long and include at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number, and one special character."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart":9},{"id":"E6Pj4T_dhaMbL9qxFm8R3","type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"BCN-18444: Added a button to the Diagnostic Web Server to enable resetting of the default DWS certificates."}],"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","listStart"